{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_narant_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_narant_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"何处寻宝藏","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_narant_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"434c6526f2120b81ba9cf2e609772a529578f4804696a7593437bea56ffd42c2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"娜仁图亚捡到了一只金壶灯，上面记录着宝藏的下落。娜仁图亚付出了不小的代价才抵达目的地，结果似乎与她的预想完全不同。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"narration","text":"“呸呸！呸呸呸！”\n“谁在路上挖的坑？腰都差点摔断了，还害我吃了一嘴沙子！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红发的库兰塔狼狈地从沙洞中爬出，脚上还套着一个被踩穿的驮兽头骨。\n她顾不上拍去身上的沙尘，转身就对着空旷的荒漠一顿臭骂。\n她也不知道自己在骂谁，但越想越生气，干脆拔下脚上套着的头骨往远处扔去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪家的商队，驮兽掉进坑里都不知道来找一找吗？我的大腿差点就被那几根骨头戳穿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多货物，净是些破麻布，也不知道运些值钱玩意！*萨尔贡粗口*差点让我白摔一回！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚举起一直拿在手上的物件，这是沙洞中唯一冒着金光的东西，被她顺手带了出来。\n借着炽烈的阳光，她仔细打量起这孤单的战利品。\n这是一只金灿灿的壶灯，花纹繁复，光泽惊人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金子做的？应该能值不少钱！哈哈哈，倒也算是因祸得福！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚将手中的金壶灯在衣服上仔细擦了擦，金晃晃的亮光反射在她脸上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这上面好像刻着字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“送给泉眼镇的阿萨夫，祝你八岁生日快乐，爱你的母亲。”\n“请爱惜它，它能照出我留给你的所有宝藏。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些有钱人，还真是可恶！给小孩的生日礼物居然都是沉甸甸的金子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我去巴扎把这个金壶灯换成好酒好肉吃进肚子，就算给那些被有钱人欺负的穷苦百姓报仇了，哈哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚走出几步，娜仁图亚突然停了下来。她又低下头，仔细确认壶灯上刻着的字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“宝藏”，我确实没认错吧？是写着“宝藏”吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么有钱的人留下的宝藏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里面的宝贝，肯定要比这只金壶灯更值钱！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家伙，赶紧滚出来，有事问你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"火气这么大，先喝两杯浇浇火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这片荒漠里跑过的地方比我多，有没有听说过“泉眼镇”这个地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然！泉眼镇嘛，那不就在......嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快告诉我那地方在哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你要寻仇，还是抢钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然是个有钱的地方，是吧？快把那地方的位置告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"不急不急，陪我喝两杯我就告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，刚好我也渴了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么只倒了一杯？你不喝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"喝呀，这杯就是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你先付钱，我才能给你倒呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我缺你这点酒钱吗？多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"一百......不，两百第纳尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚摸向腰间钱袋的手顿住了，她咬牙切齿地问——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这掺了水的亚力酒值两百第纳尔一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"但你想知道的消息值这个价呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"娜仁图亚，我无意打听你要去泉眼镇做什么。无论你是接了委托要去杀谁，还是捡到藏宝图要去挖出一地窖的金子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就两百第纳尔吗？我付得起，拿酒来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"呦呵，看来被我说中了......瞪我干什么？瞧瞧我这副老骨头，你总不会担心我要抢你的宝贝吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳！两百第纳尔一杯的酒还是一样难喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一杯够不够让你开口？不够就再来一杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚干脆把整个钱袋都扔给对方。她龇牙咧嘴的，不知道是因为酒太呛还是因为太心疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我倒上呀，钱袋子里绝对够两百第纳尔了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"两百是第一杯的价格，嘿嘿，第二杯得四百第纳尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这里可不能动手呀，娜仁图亚。我知道你能打，但每个巴扎有每个巴扎的规矩，我的规矩就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你情我愿，概不退款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是喝一杯就够了，也行。我想这荒漠上这么多想发财的沙盗，总有一两个舍得来找我买两杯酒喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我半个钟头，我会带着钱回来......你最好不要跟别人说漏嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚拍了拍腰间的弯刀，挤出一副最凶狠的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，放心......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"砰！\n一个沉甸甸的钱袋砸在桌台上，将正在打瞌睡的假酒贩子吓得滚到了地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚一把抢过桌台后的酒瓶，仰起脖子猛灌了几口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不数一数？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"还数什么，你这一袋子至少有一千第纳尔了！娜仁图亚，你该不会是去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把驮兽卖给商队换来的钱，别大惊小怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候有一只驮兽了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚，从一支过路的商队那里偷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个商队，该不会是同一支吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是同一支。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"那些蠢货就没发现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。想知道是怎么回事的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就*萨尔贡粗口*赶紧把泉眼镇的位置告诉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"好好......别着急嘛，我先给你倒上一杯——这可是我珍藏的好酒，绝对没掺水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一杯烈酒下肚，娜仁图亚看向假酒贩子递来的“地图”。\n说是地图，实际只是一张餐巾纸，上面用笔画了些弯弯扭扭的线条，代表山与商道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么远，走一趟至少得三四天......你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么时候骗过人？咳咳，我什么时候骗过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"这么远的路，你靠两条腿肯定是走不过去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算把你的那头又老又聋的驮兽卖给我？拴在帐篷后面那头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你真聪明！不贵不贵，八百第纳尔就卖给你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那头驮兽跟着你就没吃过一顿饱饭。它给你拉了一辈子货，结果你现在打算把它卖给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是嫌贵，我就只能把它杀掉吃肉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚摇了摇头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的意思是，你卖得太便宜了，我觉得它至少值一千第纳尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚抓起那张“地图”塞进怀里，将杯中余酒一饮而尽，转身就要走出帐篷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！娜仁图亚，你还没告诉我，那支商队为什么没发现自己的驮兽被你偷走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我抓它的时候带了把麦子，它就安安静静地跟我走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"就这么简单？真是没劲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"不过那些商队平日里低买高卖，赚那么多亏心钱，活该被偷，也是自作自受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自作自受......是啊。哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚前脚刚走，假酒贩子就开始一脸紧张地收拾起帐篷中的杂物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"买醉的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老板，这么早就急着关门啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"对，对，你等明天再来光顾......不对，明天我不来这个巴扎了，以后有缘再见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"买醉的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你欠债了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"骗了一个疯子的钱，得趁她回来之前赶紧溜......你瞎打听什么，赶紧走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"假酒贩子背着行李跑到帐篷外，才发现自己用来拴驮兽的桩子上只剩下一截光秃秃的绳子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"假酒贩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"*萨尔贡粗口*娜仁图亚！原来你是偷了我的驮兽去卖钱的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝藏的影子都还没见到，就已经把我身上的钱全花光了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝藏啊宝藏......嗝——你可千万别让我失望......里面最好全是金锭，大门也得是金子做的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚爬到山坡的顶端，掏出地图比对眼前的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？这里不该有座山吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我拿倒了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！倒过来看是一座村子。这下对上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚使劲揉了揉自己的眼睛，朝前方望去，却总是模模糊糊看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝完酒就一直口渴得厉害，得去找个有井水的地方过夜，最好还能弄到一头代步的驮兽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚摇摇晃晃地站了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......喝酒误事！这假酒的后劲怎么这么大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刚走出几步，娜仁图亚就一脚踩进了鼷兽打出的浅坑，脚腕一软，整个人便顺着山坡滚了下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的脑袋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再、再也！不喝假酒了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......头好痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这是在哪......什么东西，湿答答的......下雨了吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚睁开眼，一只面熟的驮兽正热情地舔舐着她的脸蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驮兽在这里，快跟上！欸，这不是昨天卖驮兽的那个人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这是怎么回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，地图！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚连忙在身上翻找，所幸那张皱巴巴的地图还在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你们没有碰我的东西吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们才刚追着驮兽到这里，看样子，你是从山坡上摔下来的？瞧瞧你这一身伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该不会是来买回这头驮兽的吧？你想买回去的话，至少得三千第纳尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，贵了两倍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不，我们全指望这只认路的老驮兽帮我们找水源呢！没想到它先找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是它在我身上闻到了熟悉的酒味......对了，你们也朝这个方向走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会经过泉眼镇吗？就是这张地图上标出来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......“地图”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是我拿卖驮兽的钱换来的，也许是我拿倒了，你再看看，泉眼镇应该就在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不必看了！你恐怕是被骗了，这上面根本就是乱画的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被骗了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会儿我也想起来了，泉眼镇......那可是个很有钱的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜几十年前闹灾，人全都搬走了。现在只有一个泉眼村，倒是和我们要去的地方顺路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可金壶灯上明明写的是“泉眼镇”，难道是叫习惯了才没改口？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然顺路，能不能捎我一段，我到地方再付给你们钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们做点小本生意，赊不了账呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......我给你们当保镖？不用给工钱的那种！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那边三十个全副武装的壮汉，都是我们的保镖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你们喂驮兽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有专门的饲养员，日夜轮班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们还缺什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想......倒是缺个帮忙收集驮兽粪便做燃料的。不过得一直跟在商队最后面步行，这种活儿你恐怕不愿意干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我干！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等快到地方，我就挑头健壮的驮兽骑走！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（转手价格居然贵了两倍，一群奸商！该给你们留个教训！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真是辛苦你了，跟在后面吃了一整天的沙尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何止是......沙子。你们究竟给这些驮兽喂了些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有水吗？我想洗把脸，还有手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒漠里的水很珍贵，你又不是不知道。忍忍吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先把你今天捡到的都给我吧......你说这一车都是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在只关心，什么时候能到泉眼村。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了，快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还——没到吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还没到吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了，真的快了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没到......算了，先把你那三十个保镖叫来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你再说“快了”，我就揍死你。怕你说我以强欺弱，我允许你带保镖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，马上就到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我指给你看——就在那！河岸边上那十几间棚屋，瞧见了吗？之前都在绕路，这次是真的快到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绕路？你什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要做生意嘛！泉眼村那地方现在又穷又破，谁家商队不是绕着走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（又穷又破？要是让你们知道那里有宝藏......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你从一开始就没打算带我去泉眼村？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来也只是说捎你一段嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我跟在商队后面捡驮兽粪便，算哪门子“捎一段”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我实在没力气了，我真想狠狠揍你一顿......我自己去泉眼村！这些玩意，谁爱捡谁捡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别往我身上扔啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这件丝绸外套全被你弄脏了！这可是要扣钱的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我哪有工钱可扣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这我不管，损坏的一律按原价三倍赔偿，我算算，你现在欠我两千七百第纳尔，你用金券付账的话要再加百分之十手续费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在身上没有钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我借给你。按日计息，一天下来利息就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音，嘎嘣嘎嘣的......你一副咬牙切齿的样子是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必动手呢，你身上就没什么值钱的东西了吗？我看，你腰上系着的那个东西就挺值钱的嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚低头看向腰间，用破布包裹起来的金壶灯不知什么时候露出了壶柄，金灿灿的颜色很扎眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有三十个保镖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有四把刀，你可以来试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，算我怕了你了！好歹我们之间也是做过生意的，你怎么像个沙盗一样蛮不讲理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我蛮不讲理？我......我本来就是沙盗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是沙盗，也要买粮，也要销赃嘛。你有宝贝，我可以先帮你估个价，说不定将来还要卖给我呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚气愤地掏出金壶灯，抵在商队头领的鼻尖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我缺你那点钱吗？看见没，金子做的！买下你所有的驮兽都有剩的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？金子？但我怎么觉得，不太像啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"商队头领用指甲在金壶灯上刮了一下，壶灯表面居然露出了暗淡的底色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，明明就是铜胎的嘛，不过涂了一层金漆......哈哈，你是不是又被谁骗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这手艺确实不错，如果不是我见得多，说不定真被骗到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":"avg_npc_1492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道你这么好骗，买你的驮兽的时候就应该多砍砍价，哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"商队头领每说一句，娜仁图亚的脸色就更阴沉一分。她捏紧了那只“金”壶灯，似乎要把它捏成碎片。\n娜仁图亚抬头看向商队头领那张喋喋不休的嘴，她已经听不见对方在说些什么，她只觉得烦躁无比。\n于是她举起了拳头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商队头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊呦！你敢打我......我那三十个保镖呢？快来救命啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚现在很渴，很饿，很累，很生气。\n她手往腰间摸，摸到了空瘪的钱袋，对了，她现在还很穷。\n然后她摸到了那只壶灯，她抡圆了胳膊，把壶灯朝着天空狠狠地扔出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*萨尔贡粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是你害的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"壶灯在空中转了不知道多少圈，最终直直地砸下来，差点砸到娜仁图亚头顶。\n壶灯落在沙地上，刻着字的一面朝上，娜仁图亚不用看也记得上面的内容是什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宝藏，我呸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚拖着疲惫的身子往前走，她也不知道自己要去哪里，她只想离那个壶灯远一些。\n但走着走着，她又想起了上面刻着的另一行字——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚气得狠狠踢了一脚沙子，结果不凑巧踢到了坚硬的石块，眼泪差点都疼出来了。\n她缓了一会儿，还是走回去捡起了那个壶灯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只有一丝机会，也不能放弃......宝藏啊宝藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可别再让我失望了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是泉眼镇，不，泉眼村，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你找谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿萨夫......这里有这个人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"你找他干什么？我们没见过你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来话长，你把他叫出来，我有个东西要交给他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"有人要找阿萨夫爷爷吗？他病得很重，村长说了，谁都不准靠近他的屋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......爷爷？阿萨夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是搞错了，我要找的阿萨夫是个八岁的小孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"泉眼村从来都只有一个阿萨夫，他今年已经一百零一岁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是他的子女搬走了不肯照顾他，他也许还能打破我们这里的长寿记录呢，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人照顾他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"打听这么多干什么？反正不许你进村子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚无奈地拿出那个金灿灿的壶灯，她留了个心眼，用拇指盖住了掉漆的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我见他一面，如果真的是我要找的人，这东西送给你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"村民们看着那坨金光闪闪的东西，犹豫地对视了一眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚走进了这间逼仄的棚屋，扑面而来的是夹杂着浓郁草药气味的灰尘。\n一位形容枯槁的老人正卧在榻上，胸口剧烈起伏，喉咙里发出风箱一般的杂音。\n娜仁图亚能察觉到，他的生命正在流逝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撑住！你还不能......不能！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚扑到床榻前，将那个稍微变形的壶灯塞进老人手里。\n她握着老人枯瘦的手，将壶灯举在阳光下，金色的光芒映照在老人的眼中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这里，刻着字呢！我念给你听——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“送给泉眼镇的阿萨夫，祝你八岁生日快乐，爱你的母亲。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是阿萨夫对吧？这是你妈妈送给你的生日礼物，可惜路上遇到了意外，才让你等了这么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿萨夫，你能听到吗？我把你妈妈送给你的金壶灯交给你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人瞪大了眼睛，嘴唇翕动，却没能发出一个完整的音节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，“妈妈”，你还记得她，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还记不记得，她说的“宝藏”，藏在哪里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝——藏，宝藏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"即将离去的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没听清，你再说一遍好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚将耳朵贴近老人的嘴巴，却意外地感觉到老人的手恢复了一丝力气。\n他握住了那只金壶灯，紧紧贴在自己心脏的位置。\n然后，老人向从屋顶照进来的那一束阳光慢慢伸出了手。\n“送给泉眼镇的阿萨夫......”\n“......它能照出我留给你的所有宝藏。”\n阳光照在老人的手心和脸庞上，娜仁图亚不知道他在那一束阳光里看见了什么，但老人的脸上的的确确浮现出了一抹安心的微笑。\n老人闭上了眼，轻轻说了一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"即将离去的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我看见了。妈妈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"即将离去的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，宝藏呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人不满地睁开眼。娜仁图亚发誓她看见这个行将就木的老人冲她翻了个白眼。\n老人再度张开嘴唇，娜仁图亚连忙凑近——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"村长，就是她非要见阿萨夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"她手上有金子，她说了要送给我们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚没有理会。她拔出腰间的刀，插进地面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有没有给他准备墓地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚挑选了一棵枯死的树木，她将那只掉漆的金壶灯与老人一同埋葬在了枯树下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别嫌远，他们不让你埋在村子里，我有什么办法？我把你背过来也费了不少力气呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个山头正对着泉眼村，你要是想家了，随时都能看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这棵树也不错，可以遮遮阴，也不怕沙子烫脊背。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以后我要是路过这里，看到这棵树，也就知道你在哪儿了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚靠着树干坐下，活动起麻木的双手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到这一趟，又亏钱又亏力气，忙活到头，还要帮别人料理后事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果我梦寐以求的宝藏，就只是母亲对孩子的祝福而已啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我都已经扔掉那只壶灯，转头离开了，要不是想到还有个男孩坐在门槛上，眼巴巴地等着自己的生日礼物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道，那个等生日礼物的男孩，已经等了这么多年。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚拍了拍那棵枯树，从接触处传来空洞的回声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后再也不干这种亏本买卖了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚一边叹气，一边站起身。在离开前，她又给了那棵枯树一拳，似乎是要发泄一下心里的郁闷。\n咔嚓——\n这一拳似乎有些太重了。枯树裂开了一道长长的口子，露出了中间的空洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......千万别是什么风干的驮兽粪便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚伸手向树洞中摸去。她摸到了一个形状奇特的东西，拿在手里沉甸甸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一只精致的酒杯，表面花纹繁复，镶满了宝石。但无论是工艺还是形制，都和之前那只壶灯完全不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚将它举到眼前，在夕阳的映照下，这只酒杯闪着耀目的金光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这究竟是怎么回事？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚忍不住去仔细端详那只金酒杯。\n借着夕阳最后的余晖，她好像在酒杯的底托上瞄到了一些细微的刻痕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜仁图亚猛地闭上眼，抓着那只酒杯，认命一般直挺挺往后倒去，仰躺在沙地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁图亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是现在！我现在已经......太累了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
